15:
Moses nAaisraeli oyi imbile Omuwa eimbilo ndika tali ti:
“Otandi imbile Omuwa, oshoka okwa mono esindano enene;
uukambe naakayili yawo okwe ya undulile mefuta.

Owa fudhile efuta, omeya noga thikama;
oga thikama ga fa omakuma;
ondaandelo yefuta oye ya pontundulu.

Omutondi okwa ti:
‘Etha utale ndi ya landule notandi ya kwata po;
otii ka hakana uuyamba,
ndi kuthe shoka nda hala;
otandi pweya mo egongamwele lyandje,
e te kutha po ayihe yawo.’

Omuwa, owa fudha lumwe aluke,
nAayegipiti ya kulukile mo;
oya ningine mo ya fa ooshumbu momeya omatilithi.

Aawiliki Aaedom oya tila;
aalumentu aanankondo yokuMoab otaa kakama;
Aakaanana oya kanitha omukumo gwawo.

21:
Omolwashoka mEmbo lyehingo lyiita yOmuwa mwa tiwa:
“…oshilando Vaheb moshikandjo Sufa nomasilu;
omulonga Arnon

Pethimbo ndyoka Aaisraeli oyi imbi eimbilo ndika taa ti:
“Muthima ngoye, vivila omeya;
tse otatu ku kundu nokwiimba.

24:
e ta totomona ehunganeko lye ta ti:
“Bileam yaBeor, popya;
omulumentu gwomeho ga tonata, uvitha!

Okwa totomona ehunganeko lye a ti:
“Bileam yaBeor, popya;
omulumentu gwomeho ga tonata, uvitha!

32:
“Dhiladhila utale nale, omathimbo gonale ndjiya;
pula ooho ye ku lombwele shoka sha ningilwe,
pula aakulupe ye ku hokololele iinima yonale.

33:
Kezimo lyaJuda okwa ti:
“Omuwa, uva onkugo yaJuda;
mu hanganitha noshigwana she.
Okwe ya kondjele niikaha ye;
mu kwatha ta pi kaatondi ye.”

Kezimo lyaDan okwa ti:
“Dan okwa fa onime ongundjuka;
ota ndjomboka ta zi kuBaasha.”

10:
Esiku ndyoka Omuwa a pe Aaisraeli esindano okusinda Aayamori, Josua okwa popi nOmuwa. Okwa popi montaneho yAaisraeli a ti:
“Tango, kankama thilu muGibeon;
Mwedhi, mwena molusilu lwaAjalon.”

5:
Hambeleleni Omuwa!
Aaisraeli oya li yu uthilwa okukondja;
aantu oya zimine nenyanyu.

Debora, iilando yaIsrael ya thikama ye ethiwa;
oya kulumana yi li omupulungundju, sigo we ya,
sigo wa uluka ko ngaashi yina yaIsrael.

Aawiliki yaIssaskar oye ya pamwe naDebora;
eeno, Issaskar okwe ya ndele naBarak wo,
noye mu landulile molusilu.
Ihe ezimo lyaReuben olya li lya limbililwa;
inaa vula okutokola, ngele otaye ya.

Sisera okwe mu indile omeya,
ihe okwe mu pe omahini;
okwe mu etele omoosi mombago yuuzeko.

Moshikaha shimwe oku na omboha yotenda
nomoshikwawo ohamala;
okwa mokola Sisera e ta tatula olukwe lwe;
oku ulula omutse gwe.

15:
Simson nokwi imbi eimbilo tali ti:
“Aalumentu eyuvi limwe onde ya dhipaga noluyego lwokasino;
onoluyego lwokasino onde ya ndumbike mondumba.”

2:
Hanna okwa galikana a ti:
“Omuwa oku udhitha omutima gwandje enyanyu;
ondu uvite uunelago kushoka Omuwa a ningile ndje!
Otandi yolo aatondi yandje;
onda nyanyukwa, oshoka Kalunga okwa kwatha ndje!

Kaku na omuyapuki a fa Omuwa;
kaku na nando ogumwe e mu fa,
kaku na omugameni a fa Kalunga ketu.

Omuwa ota dhipaga nota yumudha;
aantu ote ya tumu muusi
e te ya galula mo ishewe.

Ota gamene oomwenyo dhaamboka ye mu inekela,
ihe aakolokoshi otaa kanene momilema;
omulumentu ita sindana molwoonkondo dhe mwene.

Aatondi yOmuwa otaa ka yonwa po;
ote ke ya ndundumina e li megulu.
Omuwa ota ka pangula uuyuni auhe;
ota ka pa omukwaniilwa gwe oonkondo,
omukwaniilwa omuhogololwa gwe ote ke mu ninga omusindani.”

1:
“Omvula nenge omume inayi gwila koondundu dhaGilboa;
omalundu gadho naga kale aluhe ga kunyuka!
Oshoka omahuuyanza gomapenda ga gwithilwa pevi;
ehuuyanza lyaSaul inali lomonwa we nomagadhi.

22:
Kalunga kandje oye omugameni gwandje,
puye ondi li nawa.
Oye oshikandekitho tashi gamene ndje;
ota shigi ndje e ta kaleke ndje nawa.
Oye omukulili gwandje;
ota gamene ndje e ta hupitha ndje kiiponga.

Muudhigu wandje ondi ithana Omuwa;
ondi ithana Kalunga kandje, a kwathe ndje.
Oku uvu ewi lyandje motempeli ye;
okwa pulakene okulilila kwandje ekwatho.

Nena evi olyi inyenge e tali kakama;
omakota goondundu oga tanduka e taga dhedhema,
oshoka Kalunga okwa li a geya.

Omuwa okwa ganeke okwooko kwe
e ta kwata ndje;
okwa hili ndje mo mondowi.

Omuwa ota futu ndje,
oshoka ohandi longo shoka shu uka;
ota yambeke ndje, oshoka ine yona sha.

Omuwa, ongoye to gamene ndje e to hupitha ndje;
esiloshimpwiyu lyoye olya nenepekitha ndje,
noonkondo dhoye odha gamene ndje.

Otandi ya pundulile pevi,
yo itaa vulu we okuthikama;
oya gwile po nde ya sinda.

Owa hupitha ndje miikaha yaadhudhu
nowa ningi ndje omupangeli gwiigwana;
aantu nda li ndaa ya shi, oya ningi aalelwa yandje.

nota hupitha ndje miikaha yaatondi yandje.
Omuwa, oto sinditha ndje aatondi yandje;
oto gamene ndje miikaha yaapwidhi.

Kalunga ota gandja omasindano omakumithi komukwaniilwa gwe;
ota holola ohole ye yaaluhe kungoka e mu hogolola,
oDavid noluvalo lwe sigo aluhe.

12:
David sho a li muHebron, aakwiita oyendji ya dheuka oya gama komatanga ge noku mu kwathela, ye mu ninge omukwaniilwa peha lyaSaul, ngaashi Omuwa a li u uvaneka. Omiyalu dhawo otadhi landula mpaka:
Juda: aalumentu ya homata nawa ye na iikandekitho nomagonga 6 800;
Simeon: aalumentu ya dheuka nawa ye li 7 100;
Levi: aalumentu 4 600;
Aalanduli yaJehoiada moluvalo lwaAaron: aalumentu 3 700;
Aakwawo yaSadok, omukwiita omugundjuka gwoshitima: aawiliki 22;
Benjamin (ezimo lyaSaul ye mwene): aalumentu 3 000 (Aabenjamin oyendji pethimbo ndiyaka oya li natango ya gama kuSaul);
Efraim: aalumentu aanamadhina momaludhi gawo yene 20 800;
Manasse kuuninginino: aalumentu aahogololwa ya kwaniileke David ye li 18 000;
Issaskar: aawiliki ye li 200 pamwe naawilikwa yawo. (Aawiliki mbaka oya li ya tseya shoka Israel a li e na okuninga nesiku ewanawa lyoku shi gwanitha);
Sebulon: aalumentu aavuliki naainekelwa 50 000 yi ilongekidhila olugodhi, ya dheulwa okulongitha omatati niikondjitho yomaludhi agehe;
Naftali: aawiliki 1 000 naalumentu 37 000 ya homata iikandekitho nomagonga;
Dan: aalumentu ya dheuka ye li 28 600;
Aser: aalumentu ya pyokokela olugodhi ye li 40 000;
Omazimo gokuuzilo waJordan — Reuben, Gad naManasse kuuzilo: aalumentu 120 000 ye shi okulongitha omatati gomaludhi agehe.

16:
Hambeleleni Omuwa,
uvitheni uunene we;
lombweleni iigwana shoka a longo.

Nyanyukweni, oshoka tseni oye;
ayehe mboka haye mu simaneke,
naa nyanyukwe!

Hambeleleni Omuwa,
ne aantu amuhe; kombanda yevi;
tangeni eadhimo noonkondo dhe.

Hambeleleni edhina lyOmuwa lyeadhimo,
eteni omayambo ne mu ye motempeli ye.
Isizimikeni koshipala shOmuyapuki, nge ta holoka;

Mu lombweleni mu tye: “Tu hupitha, Kalunga Omuhupithi gwetu;
tu gongela pamwe, tu hupitha kiigwana,
opo tu pandule nokusimaneka edhina lyoye eyapuki.”

3:
Aalevi taa landula mpaka oya tungulula oombinga dha landula ko odhindji dhedhingililokuma:
Rehum yaBani okwa tungu ombinga ya landula ko;
Hashabia, omuleli gwetata lyoshitopolwa Keila, okwa tungu ombinga ya landula ko medhina lyoshitopolwa she;

9:
Ongoye, Omuwa Kalunga wa hogolola Abram
e to mu piitha mo muUr shomuBabilon;
owa lundulula edhina lye, li ninge Abraham.

Pondundu Sinai owa kulukile pevi wa zi megulu;
owa popitha aantu yoye
e to ya pe oompango oombwanawa nomalongo gu uka.

Oya tindi okuvulika;
oya dhimbwa ayihe we yi longo;
oya dhimbwa iinyengandunge we yi longo.
Muuntsa wawo oyi ihogololele omuwiliki,
e ya shune muupika muEgipiti.
Ihe ongoye Kalunga to dhimi po oondjo;
ongoye omunamutimahenda nomunahole, iho geye mbala.
Esilohenda lyoye enene; ino ya ekelela.

Moomvula omilongo ne,
owe ya gwanithile oompumbwe dhawo adhihe mombuga;
oonguwo dhawo inadhi kulupa, noompadhi dhawo inadhi zinda.

3:
Esiku ndyoka nali shituke omilema;
Kalunga komegulu ine li dhiladhila,
nuuyelele inau li minikila.

Omilema nomuzizimba gweso nagu li luudhile,
niikogo nayi li siikile;
uuluudhe nau li kuwikile.

Uusiku mbwiyaka nau ninge omilema;
inau yalulilwa momasiku gomumvo,
wo inau ya momwaalu gwoomwedhi.

Oonyothi dhongula nadhi luudhe;
okutegelela eluwa naku ninge osima,
uusiku inau mona oonte dhongula.

6:
Iikuti yOmunankondoawike oyi li mungame,
uuzigo wayo otau ehameke ndje;
omatilitho gaKalunga otaga halutha ndje.

Nando ongaaka, ote kala nda nyanyukwa,
eeno, ote nuka kenyanyu mokati kuuwehame uunene;
ine dhina oohapu dhOmuyapuki.

7:
Onda vulwa okukala nomwenyo;
itandi kala nagwo sigo aluhe.
Ethii ndje, okukala nomwenyo itaku kwatha sha.

9:
Kalunga oye omunandunge,
oku na oonkondo dha shiga ko;
kaku na omuntu ta vulu oku mu kondjitha.

10:
Owe eta po oombangi oompe, dhi tamaneke ndje,
nowi indjipalithile ndje ondjahi yoye;
oonkondo dhoye otadhi thindi ndje dhaa na oluthuwo.

12:
Aafuthi oye li mombili,
naambo haa geyitha Kalunga, oye li nawa;
oomboka haa humbata iikalunga miikaha yawo.

13:
Owa tula oompadhi dhandje meti;
oonkatu dhandje adhihe oho dhi tonatele
notu ulike mpoka ndi na okulyata.

14:
Omasiku gomuntu ogu uthwa nale,
omwaalu gwoomwedhi dhe owe gu ngambeka;
okwa tendelwa ongamba noita vulu oku yi konda.

15:
Oonkugo nomahalutho otage ya momakutsi ge;
uuna a fa a fudha po,
omuhanaguli ote mu matukile.

ihe ota ka kala miilando ya yonuka po
nomomagumbo gaa na aantu;
oga ethiwa ga ningi oondumba dhomamanya.

Oye ita yambapala we;
uuyamba we itau kalelele,
nomaliko ge itaga ihana we noshilongo.

Ita zi mo we momilema;
omulilo otagu fike iitutuma ye,
nomufudho gwomokana kaKalunga otagu mu tidha po.

16:
Owa kwata ndje nowa ningi ombangi yokutamaneka ndje;
onda ningi omasipa gowala,
naantu otaa tala kutya ongame omuyoni.

Kalunga ota kondjitha ndje, ota tuula ndje mondjahi ye
noti ikokotele ndje omayego;
ota tongolola ndje nda fa omutondi gwe.

Onda li ndi na ombili, ihe okwa nyanyagula ndje;
okwa kwata ndje e ta hata ndje po.
Okwa ningi ndje oshishonekwa she.

17:
Omwenyo gwandje ogwa tekauka,
nomasiku gandje oga fupipikwa;
eso otali tegelele ndje.

19:
Kalunga okwa thitike ondjila yandje,
ite vulu we okutsikila ko;
epola lyandje okwe li siikile omilema.

Aakwiita ye otaa ponokele ndje;
otaa tungile ndje ekondeka
notaa yungu oontanda dha kunduka etsali lyandje.

Aatalelipo megumbo lyandje naamboka haa yakula ndje,
kaye shi ndje we;
onda ningi omukwiilongo momeho gawo.

20:
Oti itona iikuti,
eholongo tali tayima otali tyuula mehuli lye;
ehaluko otali mu kwata.

21:
Evi lyomolusilu otali mu siikile nombili;
aantu ayehe otaye mu landulile mombila,
ongaashi oyendji ye mu tetekelele mo.

24:
Oohepele odha fa oongolo dhomombuga,
otadhi yi dhi ka konge iipalutha;
ombuga otayi palutha oyana.

Aahondeli otaa tonata momilema;
otaa dhiladhila kutya kape na ngoka e ya wete
notaa siikile iipala yawo.

Aafuthi otaa teya omagumbo uusiku,
ihe omutenya otaa ipatele meni;
inaa hala okukala muuyelele.

Nayina ote mu dhimbwa;
omazinyo otage mu li po;
nota hanagulwa po a fa omuti gwa teka po.

26:
Ayihe mbika otayi ulike oonkondo dhe;
oyo enongono lyowala momakutsi getu.
Olye tu uvu ko uunene woonkondo dhaKalunga?

30:
Uumbanda owa adha ndje;
esimano lyandje olya kanene mombepo,
nelago lyandje olya pepuka po lya fa iikogo.

Oshipa shandje osha luudha, sha ninga omakoko
notashi natuka ko kolutu;
olutu lwandje otalu pi kolwiidhi.

33:
“Kandi na uusama washa;
inandi ninga sha sha puka.
Onda yela nokandi na oondjo dhasha.

Kalunga okwa hupitha ndje meso;
otandi kala ndi na omwenyo
nokutala uuyelele we.”

Ngele ou na sha shokupopya,
otandi pulakene;
popya owala, onda hala u ipopile.

34:
Otaa si ombaadhilila mokati kuusiku.
Kalunga ota shikashika aantu, notaa kana po;
aanankondo ote ya kombo po pwaa na onkambadhala yasha.

36:
Kala wa tseya kutya oohapu dhandje kadhi shi dhiifundja;
nguka e li koshipala shoye,
oye omulumentu omunandunge.

Kalunga oye omunankondo,
ihe ina dhina aantu;
oha dhiginine edhiladhilo lye.

Ota gamene aayuuki;
ote ya kwaniileke pamwe naakwaniilwa
e te ya simaneke sigo aluhe.

37:
Nena otaku uvika endundumo lyewi lye;
oye omukwaniilwa ta ndunduma,
noombadhi otadhi shela.

Aantu itaa vulu okutongolola etango;
uuyelele walyo otau togo omeho gawo,
uuna egulu lya yela sheke.

39:
Otayi ningile uumpogona wayo onyanya,
wa fa waa shi wayo;
kayi na ko nasha, ngele iilonga yayo tayi ningi osima yowala.

3:
Ihe Omuwa, ongoye to gamene ndje aluhe kiiponga;
oho pe ndje esindano
noho tsu ndje omukumo.

5:
Uva ndje, sho te pula ekwatho,
Kalunga kandje, omukwaniilwa gwandje.
Otandi ku indile, Omuwa;

ongula onene oto uvu ewi lyandje;
pepito lyetango otandi ku etele eindilo lyandje
notandi tegelele, u yamukule ndje.

Naa nyanyukwe ayehe mboka
haa kongo egameno pungoye;
otaa ki imba aluhe oondjimbo dhenyanyu.
Gamena mboka ye ku hole;
omolwoye oye na shili elago.

6:
Ngame onda dhengwa kuuwehame;
kehe uusiku ombete yandje oya tuta kokulila kwandje,
nontala yandje otayi hiha omahodhi.

Kandi wete ko nawa;
omeho gandje oga zinda kokulila
omolwaatondi yandje.

Aatondi yandje ayehe otaa ka mwenekwa
e taa sithwa ohoni;
otaa ka tidhwa po mepiyagano lyohaluka.

7:
Thikama, Omuwa, u geele ongeyo yaatondi yandje;
tonata, u kwathe ndje
Oto pula, uuyuuki u gwanithwe;

Ongoye omupanguli gwaantu ayehe.
Omuwa, uthila ndje okwaanuusama;
owa tseya kutya kandi na uusama.

Ngele itaa itedhulula,
Kalunga otu upike egongamwele lye.
Oye ta leve uutati we e te u lukile;

8:
Omuwa, Omuwa gwetu,
edhina lyoye olya simana ngiini muuyuni auhe!
Oto hambelelwa sigo okombanda yomagulu;

to imbilwa kuunona nokuuhanona.
Owi ikaleka kokule naatondi yoye;
oto mweneke kehe ngoka a tsa ondumbo nangoye.

9:
Aatondi yetu oya kana po sigo aluhe;
owa hanagula po iilando yawo,
noya dhimbiwa thilu.

Omuwa, mboka ye ku shi,
otaye ku inekele;
iho etha nando ogumwe ngoka te ya kungoye.

Kalunga oha dhimbulukwa mboka taa ehamekwa;
iha dhimbwa okulila kwawo
noha geele mboka haye ya ningile uuwinayi.

Aanaluhepo itaa kala ye ethiwa aluhe;
etegameno lyaathiminikwa
itali teywa po sigo aluhe.

10:
Aakolokoshi oyo aainenepeki
nohaa tidhagana oohepele;
naa yulwe koomwigo ye dhi tega yo yene.

Omukolokoshi ke na ko nasha nOmuwa;
mokwiinenepeka kwe
ota dhiladhila kutya Kalunga ita kwatha sha.

Omukolokoshi ota tsakanitha ashihe shoka te shi ningi.
Omapangulo gaKalunga ita vulu oku ga uva ko;
aatondi ye okwe ya nyonkele.

Oye ti ilombwele ta ti:
“Itandi ka adhika komupya;
itandi ka adhika nando okuudhigu washa.”

Oye ha langele aantu momikunda,
a dhipage mboka inaaya yona sha.
Oye ta ndaadha mboka itaaya vulu okwiikwatha;

Ihe ngoye Kalunga ou wete ayihe;
owa tseya uuwehame nomahepeko
nowi ilongekidha aluhe okukwatha.
Epongo otali igandja kungoye;
oho kwatha aluhe aanaluhepo.

Oto ku uva okulila kwaathiminikwa nokwoothigwa;
oto ke ya uthila pauyuuki,
opo oonakukasa yaa longe iihuna.

11:
Omuwa oye omuyuuki noku hole iilonga iiwanawa;
mboka haa longo uuwanawa,
otaa ka kala puye.

12:
Omuwa, tu kwatha!
Aayuuki inapu thigwa nando ogumwe;
itaku monika we mboka haa kala moshili.

Omauvaneko gOmuwa oge shi kwiinekelwa;
oga yela ga fa oshisiliveli
sha yelithwa momulilo luheyali.

15:
Omuntu ngoka ha vulika kuKalunga miinima ayihe
noha longo shoka shu uka;
ngo ha popi oshili ye ke na omakoto,

16:
Omuwa, ongoye awike eliko lyandje
noho pe ndje ashihe shoka nde shi pumbwa;
omwenyo gwandje ogu li miikaha yoye.

Ongoye to tseyithile ndje ondjila yomwenyo;
pungoye opu na enyanyu lyandje
nuunelago wandje sigo aluhe.

17:
Omuwa, pulakena ndje; sho te indilile uuyuuki;
gameka okutsi kwoye kokulila kwandje!
Pulakena, sho tandi ku indile nomwenyo gu uka.

Ihandi popi uukolokoshi, ngaashi yalwe haa ningi;
onda dhiginine okulandula omautho goye,
noinandi landula oondjila dhuupwidhi.

Holola ohole yoye onkumithi,
ngu u tu hupithe;
opungoye tatu holama aatondi yetu.

18:
Omuwa oye omugameni gwandje;
oye epopilongulu lyandje lya kola.
Kalunga kandje oye omugameni gwandje,
puye ondi li nawa.
Oye oshikandekitho tashi gamene ndje;
ota shigi ndje e ta kaleke ndje nawa.

Muudhigu wandje ondi ithana Omuwa;
ondi ithana Kalunga kandje, a kwathe ndje.
Oku uvu ewi lyandje motempeli ye;
okwa pulakene okulilila kwandje ekwatho.

Nena evi olyi inyenge e tali kakama;
omakota goondundu oga tanduka e taga kakama,
oshoka Kalunga okwa li a geya.

Nena Omuwa, okwa ndunduma mewangandjo;
ewi lyagwokombandambanda
olyu uvika.

Oku umbu iikuti ye,
aatondi ye e taa halakana;
nomashelo goombadhi okwe ya halakanitha po.

Omuwa okwa ganeke okwooko kwe
e ta kwata ndje;
okwa hili ndje mo mombwili yomeya.

Omuwa, ongoye to gamene ndje e to hupitha ndje;
esiloshimpwiyu lyoye olya nenepekitha ndje,
noonkondo dhoye odha gamene ndje.

Otandi ya pundulile pevi,
yo itaa vulu we okuthikama;
oya gwile po nde ya sinda.

nota hupitha ndje miikaha yaatondi yandje.
Omuwa, oto sinditha ndje aatondi yandje;
oto gamene ndje miikaha yaapwidhi.

Kalunga ota gandja omasindano omakumithi komukwaniilwa gwe;
ota holola ohole ye yaaluhe kungoka e mu hogolola,
oDavid noluvalo lwe sigo aluhe.

19:
Okusimaneka Omuwa okuwanawa;
otaku kala aluhe.
Omapangulo gOmuwa ogu uka;
kage na okatongo.

21:
Omuwa, omukwaniilwa okwa nyanyukwa,
sho we mu pe oonkondo;
ota hambelele, sho we mu ningi omusindani.

Omukwaniilwa oti inekele Omuwa Omunankondoawike;
ota kala megameno,
oshoka Omuwa oku mu hole aluhe.

22:
Oye ku ithana noya hupu moshiponga;
oye ku inekele,
yo inaa sithwa ohoni.

Ihe ngame kandi shi we omuntu;
ezinyo lyowala,
omudhinwa nomushekwa kukehe gumwe!

Ayehe mbo taa mono ndje,
otaa yolo ndje;
otaa nyonkele ndje e taa pukapuka komitse.

Oonkondo dhandje dha kana, ongomeya ga tilwahi pevi.
Omasipa gandje agehe oga dhamuka;
omutima gwandje ogwa fa eka lya hemunwa.

Ongundu yaakolokoshi oya kunduka ndje; ongoshipandi shoombwa
taa kondeke ndje;
otaa nyankula iikaha noompadhi dhandje.

Hupitha ndje, ndaa se kegongamwele;
hupitha omwenyo gwandje
momakana goombwa ndhi.

Ihe etha oohepele ye iha dhini omaudhigu gawo;
iha zi po puyo, ihe oha yamukula,
ngele taa pula ekwatho.”

Megongalo alihe otandi ku pandulile iilonga yoye;
mokati kaamboka haye ku simaneke,
otandi ku pe omayambo ngoka nde ga uvaneke.

Oohepele otaa ka lya ya kuta;
mboka taa ya kOmuwa, otaye mu simaneke.
Naa kale nelago sigo aluhe!

Iigwana ayihe otayi ka tseya Omuwa.
Koombinga adhihe dhuuyuni otaku zi aantu e taye ya kuye;
omihoko adhihe otadhi ke mu simaneka.

23:
Ongoye to yalele ndje oshililo montaneho yaatondi yandje;
oto taamba ndje ngaashi omuyenda a simana,
e to pindi oshitenga shandje shu udhilila.

Elago nesilohenda lyoye
otali landula ndje mokukalamwenyo kwandje akuhe;
otandi ka kala aluhe mongulu yOmuwa.

25:
Kalunga kandje, onde ku inekela.
Ino ethela ndje mohoni yesindiko;
aatondi yandje yaa shi nyanyukilwe.

Gamena ndje, ngu u hupithe ndje;
ino etha, ndi sindike.
Opungoye te kongo egameno.

27:
Omuwa oye uuyelele nomuhupithi gwandje;
itandi tila nando olye.
Omuwa ota gamene ndje kiiponga ayihe;
itandi mbandama.

Methimbo lyuudhigu ota shigi ndje;
ota gamene ndje motempeli ye
e ta londeke ndje kemanya ele.

28:
Ya geelela iilonga yawo, uuwinayi ye u ninga.
Ya geelela iilonga yawo ayihe;
ya futa pakulonga kwawo.

Omuwa ota gamene ndje e ta popile ndje;
onde mu inekela.
Oye ta kwatha ndje e ta nyanyudha ndje;
otandi mu imbile omaimbilo genyanyu.

Omuwa ota gamene aantu ye;
ota popile e ta hupitha
omukwaniilwa omuhogololwa gwe.

29:
Simanekeni uunene wedhina lyOmuwa;
tseni oongolo koshipala shOmuyapuki,
sho ta holoka.

Ewi lyOmuwa otali uvika momafuta;
Kalunga keadhimo ota ndunduma,
newi lye otali mbolongondja kombanda yomafuta.

30:
Oondjila dhandje owe dhi shitukitha oondjimbo dhenyanyu;
owa kodheke oluhodhi lwandje
nowa nyanyudha ndje.

31:
Omuwa, otandi ya kungoye okukonga egameno;
ino etha, ndi sindike.
Ongoye Kalunga omuyuuki;
otandi galikana, hupitha ndje.

Otandi igameke kungoye.
Omuwa, ongoye to hupitha ndje;
ongoye Kalunga omudhiginini.

Aatondi yandje ayehe, naashiinda, otaa yolo ndje.
Aashiwikile yandje oya tila ndje;
ngele taa mono ndje mepandaanda, otaa yi ndje ontuku.

Ayehe oya dhimbwa ndje,
ongo nda sa;
onda fa oshiyagaya showala.

Ondi li aluhe meke lyoye;
hupitha ndje miikaha yaatondi yandje,
noyaamboka haa tidhagana ndje.

Omuwa, otandi ku ithana;
ino etha, ndi sithwe ohoni.
Aadhudhu oyo naa sithwe ohoni;
naa thenunukile moshaasi.

32:
Uusiku nomutenya wa li wa geela ndje, Omuwa;
omatha gandje oga li ga kana,
ngaashi oshitosi tashi thekuka po kuupyu wopothinge.

33:
Aayuuki amuhe,
ligoleleni iilonga yOmuwa;
mu hambeleleni, amuhe mbo hamu vulika kuye.

34:
Omapongo otage mu ithana,
oye note ga yamukula;
ote ya hupitha moothina dhawo adhihe.

35:
Ihe ehanagulo otali ya akele, manga inaaye li ndhindhilika;
otaa iyulitha komwigo ye gu tega
e taa gwile meyonuuko!

Ihe ngame otandi nyanyukilwa Omuwa;
otandi shambukwa,
oshoka okwa hupitha ndje.

Ihe sho ya li muuvu, onda si oluhodhi;
ondi ikeye iikulya;
onda galikana nomutse gwa nyongama,

Sigo uunake, Omuwa, wa tala ko owala?
Yugulula ndje momahomono gawo;
hupitha omwenyo gwandje koonime ndhika.

Ihaa popi nombili;
ihe otaa toto iifundja yi ili noyi ili
okulundila aaholi yombili.

Ihe ngoye, Omuwa, shika osha ningwa momeho goye.
Onkee ano, Omuwa, ino mwena;
ino kala ndje kokule!

Omuwa, ongoye omuyuuki,
onkee uthila ndje pauyuuki;
ino etha aatondi yandje, ya yole ndje.

Mbo taa nyanyukilwa uudhigu wandje, naa sindwe e taa piyaganekwa;
mbo taa idhiladhilile uulinawa ye vule ndje,
naa yolwe e taa si ohoni.

36:
Okupopya kwe okwiinayi noku udha iifundja;
iha longo we sha shoondunge
nenge oshiwanawa.

Mokulala kwe oha tungu oompangela dhuudhudhu;
iha longo nando osha shu uka
ye iha tindi okulonga uuwinayi.

Uuyuuki woye otau yeluka wa fa oondundu;
eutho lyoye olya fa uule wefuta.
Aantu niinamwenyo oyi li meke lyoye.

37:
Idhidhimika e to tege Omuwa, a longe sha;
ino impwiyika naambo taa piti nawa
nenge mbo taa enditha oompangela dhawo dhuudhudhu.

Ihe aakolokoshi otaa ka yonuka po;
aatondi yOmuwa otaa ka thekuka po
ongoongala dhokelundu;
otaa ka kana po ya fa olwithi.

Onda tseya omunanyanya omunankondo;
okwa taandele koombinga adhihe
a fa omusendeli gwaLibanon.

Undja omuyuuki,
ngu u ndhindhilike omunamikalo;
omunambili oku na oluvalo olwindji,

Ote ya kwatha e te ya hupitha;
ote ya hupitha miikaha yaadhudhu,
oshoka opuye haa kongo egameno.

38:
Onda dhengwa, nda pwa po thilu;
otandi tongo kuuwehame
momutima gwandje.

Ookuume naashiinda yandje itaa hedha ndje we popepi
omolwomathina gandje;
nooyakwetu oya tameke okukala ndje kokule.

Ino etha aatondi yandje,
ya yole okuhepa kwandje;
ino ya etha, yu uvile uuntsa okupunduka kwandje!

39:
nenge omuzizimba gwowala.
Ashihe shi ta ningi, itashi kwatha sha;
ota ndumbile omaliko ye ina tseya kutya otaga ka ninga galye.

40:
Aanelago oomboka haa inekele Omuwa;
mbo ihaa gama kiimenka
nenge ya simaneke iikalunga iifundja.

Elaka lyehupitho inandi li ingungunina;
onda hokolola aluhe uudhiginini nekwatho lyoye.
Megongalo lyaantu yoye ayehe ine vula okumwena;
onda ti kutya ou shi kwiinekelwa nou na ohenda.

41:
Omuwa ote ya gamene e te ya shigi kiiponga;
ote ya kaleke nawa moshilongo;
ite ya ethele miikaha yaatondi yawo.

Mbo taa talele ndje po, kaye li moshili;
otaa totele ndje omahokololo omawinayi
notaa yi e taa ga taandelitha akuhe.

Oto kwatha ndje,
oshoka ohandi longo shoka shu uka;
oto kaleke ndje aluhe pungoye.

43:
Kalunga, uthila ndje pauyuuki,
popila ndje mepangulo mokati kaantu yaa na ohenda;
hupitha ndje maafundja nomaakolokoshi.

44:
Ihe ngashingeyi owe tu ekelehi
nowe tu etha, tu sindike;
ito tidha po we aatondi yetu.

45:
Ngoye ependa mokati komakanda agehe;
ngoye omupopi onkulungu.
Kalunga okwe ku yambeka aluhe.

Iikuti yoye oya tsa,
otayi tyuula momitima dhaatondi yoye;
iigwana otayi ihata poompadhi dhoye.

46:
Onkee ano itatu tila sha,
evi nando nali kakamithwe
noondundu nando nadhi gwile muule wefuta;

Kalunga oku li moshilando shoka,
noitashi ka yonagulwa po;
petendo lyeluwa ote ya, e shi gamene.

Ota hulitha po omalugodhi kombanda yevi alihe;
ota teya omatati, ta ndonyona omagonga,
niikandekitho ote yi fike po.

47:
Aapangeli yiigwana otaa gongalele pamwe naantu yaKalunga kaAbraham.
Kalunga oye omunankondo e vule omatangakwiita agehe;
oye omupangeli a shiga ko.

48:
Sion, ondundu yaKalunga, oyo onde noyo opala;
oshilando shomukwaniilwa omunene
otashi nyanyudha uuyuni auhe.

Aasioni ayehe naa nyanyukwe!
Omapangulo goye ogu uka;
ondigolo nayi kale miilando yaJuda.

49:
Omuntu ita vulu okwiihupitha;
ita vulu okufuta Kalunga,
e mu kaleke nomwenyo,

Oombila dhawo odho omagumbo gawo sigo aluhe;
omo moka taa kala aluhe,
nonando oya li ye na omayana gawo yene.

Esimano lyomuntu,
itali vulu oku mu hupitha moonyala dheso;
ota ka sa owala a fa oshinamwenyo.

ita vulu okuya nalyo,
uuna ta mana oondjenda;
eliko lye itali ke mu thindikila kombila.

Esimano lyomuntu
itali vulu oku mu hupitha moonyala dheso;
ota ka sa ashike a fa oshinamwenyo.

50:
Kalunga ketu ote ya, ihe ite ende a mwena;
omulilo hagu lungunitha otagu mu tetekele,
nomalaka gomulilo oge mu kundukidha.

“Aantu yandje, pulakeneni, ongame tandi popi;
Israel, otandi ku tamaneke.
Ongame Kalunga, Kalunga koye.

Ithana ndje esiku lyuudhigu woye;
ngame otandi ku hupitha,
ngoye e to simaneke ndje.”

51:
Kutha po ondjo yandje, ndi kale nda yogekeka;
yoga ndje, ndi kale nda yela
ndi vule oonguwo oontokele.

Pulakenitha ndje omawi genyanyu nogeligolo;
nonando wa dhenge ndje nokudhengelela,
otandi ka nyanyukwa natango.

52:
Oto longekidha okuyona po yakweni;
elaka lyoye olya tsa ngaashi okakululo.
Aluhe oto toto omahokololo giifundja.

Onkee ano Kalunga ote ku hulitha po sigo aluhe;
ote ku kwata e te ku umbile kokule noyaandjeni;
ote ku tembudha mo mehala lyaanamwenyo.

53:
Aagoya otaa ilombwele taa ti: “Kaku na Kalunga!”
Aantu mbaka oya shunduka noya longo omasithahoni;
kaku na nando ogumwe ta longo uuwanawa.

54:
Aayinenepeki otaa ponokele ndje;
aadhudhu otaa kambadhala okudhipaga ndje —
oyo aantu ihaaya dhiladhila Kalunga.

55:
Kalunga ngoka a kala omupangeli okuza nalenale,
ota ka uva ndje e te ya sindi;
oshoka otaa tindi okwiitedhulula noihaye mu tila.

56:
Kalunga, sila ndje ohenda,
oshoka onda langelwa;
aatondi yandje otaa tidhagana ndje ethimbo alihe.

Ondi inekela Kalunga noite tila;
otandi mu simanekele omauvaneko ge.
Omuntu ota ningi ndje shike?

Owa tseya, nkene ndi na uudhigu;
omahodhi gandje owe ga pungula.
Inaga nyolelwa nani membo lyoye?

58:
Naa fe oonkonkolosa tadhi hemuka po;
naa fe okanona ka valwa ka sa,
itaaka mono etango.

Manga inaaye shi tseya, otaa tetwa po ongiigwanga mepya;
mondjahi ye Kalunga ote ya pepe po,
manga ye na omwenyo.

Aayuuki otaa ka nyanyukwa,
sho taa mono aalunde taa geelwa;
otaa ende mombinzi yaakolokoshi.

59:
Tala! Otaa langele okudhipaga ndje;
aakolokoshi otaa gongalele okukondjitha ndje.
Hamolwondjo nenge epuko lyasha nde li ninga.

Omuwa, Kalunga Omunankondoawike, penduka, u kwathe ndje;
Kalunga kaIsrael, ila, u tale!
Penduka, u geele aapagani;
ino sila aakotokeli mbo aawinayi ohenda!

60:
Tu hupitha noonkondo dhoye;
zimina eindilo lyetu,
aaholike yoye opo ya hupithwe.

Gilead oshandje, naManasse osho tuu;
Efraim oye egala lyandje lyosheela,
naJuda oye ondhimbo yandje yuukwaniilwa.

62:
Onda tegelela neidhidhimiko,
Kalunga a hupithe ndje;
oye awike ndi inekela.

Oye awike ta gamene ndje e ta hupitha ndje;
oye omupopili gwandje,
noitandi ka sindika nando.

Aanenentu naathigona ayehe oyo omufudho gwowala;
ayehe kaye na po sha.
Ya tula koshiyelekitho,
ayehe kape na sha;
ayehe omufudho gwowala.

Ino inekela okulwa omakumbu; ino inekela iinima ya yugwa;
nando uuyamba woye tau tana,
ino tula mo omwenyo gwoye.

64:
Kalunga ote ya geele molwoohapu dhawo;
ayehe mboka taye ya tala,
otaa pukapuka komitse ye ya dhina.

Aantu ayehe otaa ka tila;
otaa ka hokolola iilonga yaKalunga
notaa ka dhiladhila shoka e shi longa.

65:
Owa loteke etukuluko lyomafuta
nedhengo lyomakuthikuthi;
owa mweneke omakolokosho giigwana.

Omalundu ogu udha oonzi,
nomapya oga ziza iilya;
ayihe otayi ligola ya nyanyukwa.

66:
Kehe shimwe kombanda yevi otashi isizimike kungoye;
otayi ku imbile ehambelelo
notayi simaneke edhina lyoye.”

Okwa lundulula efuta, li ninge evi ekukutu;
ootate oya taaguluka omulonga kolupadhi.
Otse otwa nyanyukilwa iilonga ye.

Epangelo lye otali kala sigo aluhe;
omeho ge otaga tongolola iigwana.
Oonakwaavulika itaa vulu okutsa ondumbo naye.

Owe etha aatondi ye tu lyatagule;
otwa piti momulilo nomomeya,
ihe owe tu eta kehala lyomahupilo.

Otandi ku yambele iimuna yo ondoka pamwe noonzi;
otandi ku pe oondumetana niikombo —
olwithi lu uke pombanda.

67:
Kalunga, tu sila ohenda
e to tu yambeke;
tu tala nolukeno,

opo uuyuni auhe u tseye ehalo lyoye;
aantu ayehe ya tseye kutya
ongoye omuhupithi.

Kalunga okwe tu yambeke;
aantu ayehe kombanda yevi
naye mu simaneke.

68:
Ya pepa po, ngaashi olwithi talu yi ombepo;
ongaashi ezi tali hemukithwa komulilo,
osho aakolokoshi taa kana po koshipala she.

Ihe aayuuki otaa shambukwa
notaa nyanyukwa koshipala shaKalunga;
otaa ligola e taa tanta.

Kalunga oye he yoothigwa
nomugameni gwaaselekadhi;
oye a kala mehala lye eyapuki.

Aantu yoye oye li lala;
eeno, Kalunga, molunza luuyamba woye
owa pe mo oohepele.

Kalunga, omusholondondo gwoye ogu wetike;
osheendo shaKalunga, omukwaniilwa gwandje,
oshu uka muuyapuki we.

KuEgipiti otaku zi aatumwa;
Aaetiopia otaa ka yelutha omaako
nokugalikana Kalunga.

Uvitheni oonkondo dhaKalunga;
uunene we ou li kombanda yaIsrael,
oonkondo dhe odhu udha ewangandjo.

Kalunga, ongoye omutilithi motempeli yoye;
Kalunga kaIsrael ota gandja oonkondo nomukumo kaantu ye.
Kalunga na simanekwe!

69:
Otandi ningine menono, nokaku na oshilyatelelo.
Onde ya puule womeya;
efundja olya kondeka ndje.

Hupitha ndje montopo;
nakula ndje miikaha yaambo ye tonde ndje,
hupitha ndje momeya omale.

Ino etha efundja li siikile ndje;
ino etha omeya ga ninginithe ndje
nenge olumbogo lu ekamene ndje okana kalwo.

Esheko olya hende omutima gwandje,
olya thigi ndje ndaa na omukwathi;
onda tegelele omunalukeno, ihe ine mona;
kapu na omuhekeleki.

Oshoka ohaa tidhagana ngo wa geela;
ohaa nyanyukilwa omeehamo
gaangoka we mu nyanyagula.

Aathiminikwa otaa uvu ondjimbo yandje
e taa nyanyukwa;
oonakukugila ekwatho kuKalunga otaa mono omukumo.

70:
Ihe ngame epongo nohepele;
Kalunga, hedha ndje mbala popepi.
Ongoye omukwathi nomuhupithi gwandje;
Omuwa, ino kala ko.

71:
Kutha ndje mo moshiponga,
hupitha ndje moluuyuuki woye;
pulakena ndje e to hupitha ndje.

Ninga eholameno lyandje lya kola
nepopilongulu lyandje li shige ndje;
ongoye eholameno nepopilo lyandje.

Onde ku inekela okuza kevalo lyandje;
owa piitha ndje mo moshivalelo shameme.
Onda hala oku ku simaneka.

Oshoka aatondi yandje oya hala okudhipaga ndje;
otaa popi ndje nayi
notaa ningi euvaneno lyawo.

Otaa ti: “Kalunga e mu thigi po;
tu mu landuleni, tu mu kwate,
oshoka kaku na ngo te mu popile.”

Aaponokeli yandje naa halakanithwe po e taa shundulwa;
mbo ya halele ndje oshiponga,
naa tidhwe po ya sa ohoni.

Omuwa Omupangeliawike,
otandi simaneke oonkondo dhoye;
uuwanawa owoye auke tandi hokolola.

Kalunga, uuyuuki woye otau adha sigo okiikogo.
Owa longa iikumitha;
kaku na ngo e ku fa.

Owa tumine ndje uudhigu nuuwehame,
ihe oto ka pa ndje oonkondo ishewe;
ito ke etha, ndi ye mombila.

72:
Uuyuuki nau pangele methimbo lye;
ombili nayi kale moshilongo,
manga omwedhi tagu minikile.

73:
Otaa yolo notaa sheke yakwawo;
oyu udha einenepeko
noya hala okuningilila mo yakwawo.

Olutu nomwenyo gwandje nando nayi name,
Kalunga oye oonkondo dhandje;
oye awike nda pumbwa.

74:
Dhimbulukwa aantu mbo we ya kulile muupika;
aantu we ya hupitha, ya ninge yoye.
Tala ondundu Sion, ehala lyokukala kwoye.

Inapu hupa nando efano lyokuholola okukalapo kwaKalunga;
inapu hupa omuhunganeki.
Kaku na ngoka a tseya kutya otashi kala ngeyi sigo uunake.

75:
Kalunga ota ti: “Ondu utha ethimbo,
uuna tandi ka pangula;
otandi ka tokola etokolo eyuuki.

76:
Aalumentu omapenda oya luwa
noya gwile moomposi dheso;
oonkondo nuungomba wawo inau ya kwatha sha.

77:
Methimbo lyuudhigu onda galikana Omuwa;
muusiku onda yelutha omaako megalikano,
ihe ite mono ehekeleko.

Omutyalakato gwoye ogu uvika moshikungulu,
nolwaadhi olwa minikile uuyuni auhe;
evi olyi inyenge e tali kakama.

Owa taula omapola mefuta;
wa pala ondjila mokati komeya omanene,
ihe oompadhi dhoye inadhi monika.

78:
Itatu yi holeke aana yetu;
otatu hokololele oluvalo lwokomeho iilonga iinene yOmuwa,
oonkondo dhe niikumitha ye.

Omuwa sho u uvu taa popi ngeyi, okwa geye;
omulilo gwe ogwa hwamene Jakob
nondjahi ye oIsrael,

Nando ongeyi, aantu oya tsikile owala okuyona;
nando ya mono iikumitha mbyoka Omuwa e yi longo,
inaa itaala.

Uuna Kalunga e ya dhenge,
mbo ya hupu ko ohaye mu kongo;
ohaa uluma okuya kuye.

Okwa hwameke omulilo gwondjahi ye mokati kawo:
ongeyo, ehanyo nekehuko;
mbika oya li ya fa aayengeli yehanagulo.

Opo ihe okwa kutha mo aantu ye ngaashi omusita gwiimuna;
okwe ya kwatele komeho
nokwe ya enditha mombuga.

Okwa tidha mo iigwana mbyo ya li mo;
evi lyawo okwe li tendele omazimo gaIsrael
nokwe li ya pe li ninge onkalelo yawo.

Okwa tungile ko otempeli ye
yi li puule ya fa egulu;
ya kola ngaashi evi ndyoka e li shiti konalenale.

79:
Kalunga, aapagani oya kwata po evi lyoye;
oya nyateke otempeli yoye ondjapuki,
Jerusalem oye shi ningi omakulukuma.

Ombinzi yaantu yoye oya tilwahi ngaashi omeya;
ashihe osha ningilwa momudhingoloko gwaJerusalem,
naasi oya nyengana okufumvika.

Ino tu geelela omayono gootate.
Tu sila ohenda mbala;
otwa shonopekwa unene.

Otse aantu yoye noonzi dhuusita woye;
otatu ku pandula aluhe
notatu ku hambelele aluhe sigo aluhe.

80:
Omusita gwaIsrael, tu uva;
ongoye omuwiliki gwaantu yoye.
Ngoye ngu wa kuutumba mokati kaakerubi, adhima!

Owe ya pe ethimbo edhigu;
owe ya pe oshikwiila sholuhodhi
noshitenga shomahodhi.

81:
Imbeni, nyanyukweni!
Kalunga oye omugameni gwetu;
imbileni Kalunga kaJakob!

Pulakeneni, ne aantu yandje,
otandi mu londodha;
Aaisraeli ne, onda hala mu uve ndje.

Mbo ye tonde ndje,
otaa ka tsila ndje oongolo kuumbanda;
okugeelwa kwawo otaku kala sigo aluhe.

82:
Ihe otamu ka sa ngaashi naanaa aantu;
omufudho gweni otagu ka hula po
ngaashi gwomuvalekele kehe.”

85:
Kalunga, omuhupithi gwetu,
tu tula ishewe omwenyo;
ino tsikila we oku tu geela.

Otse otatu ka vulika koohapu dhOmuwa;
oye oku uvanekele aantu ye ombili,
ngele itatu shuna we momapuko getu.

86:
Omuwa Kalunga kandje,
otandi ku hambelele nomwenyo aguhe;
otandi ka hokolola uunene woye sigo aluhe.

Kalunga, aanuuntsa otaa kondjitha ndje;
ongundu yaakolokoshi oya hala okudhipaga ndje —
oomboka kaaye na ko na sha nangoye.

Tala ndje, u sile ndje ohenda;
tula ndje omukumo e to hupitha ndje,
oshoka ongame omupiya gwoye ngaashi meme a li.

87:
Omuwa ota ka yalula aantu ayehe;
ayehe ote ke ya tala
oyo aakali muJerusalem.

88:
Owe etha ookuume kandje ya thige ndje po;
onda ningi oshikungitha kuyo.
Onde edhililwa mo noite vulu okuya ontuku.

89:
Owa ti: “Onda dhike ehangano
naangoka nde mu hogolola;
ondu uvanekele omupiya gwandje David nda ti:

Omuwa Kalunga Omunankondoawike,
kaku na omunankondo e ku fa;
Omuwa, ou shi kwiinekelwa miinima ayihe.

Owa shiti uumbangalantu nuumbugantu;
oondundu Tabor naHermon
otadhi ku imbile nenyanyu.

Omuwa, owe tu hogololele omugameni;
Kalunga kaIsrael omuyapuki
okwe tu pe omukwaniilwa.

Oye ota ka lombwela ndje ta ti:
‘Ongoye tate naKalunga kandje;
ongoye omugameni nomuhupithi gwandje.’

Euvaneko ndyoka nde mu uvanekele,
otali ka kala aluhe lya kola;
ehangano lyetu naye otali kala sigo aluhe.

Epangelo lye otali kala lya pama
ngaashi eyalelo;
moluvalo lwe otamu ka za ngo ta ningi omukwaniilwa aluhe.

Ayehe mbo taa piti po,
otaa yaka po eliko lye;
aashiinda ye ayehe otaye mu yolo.

Dhimbulukwa uuhupi womasiku gandje;
tseya kutya aantu atuhe we tu shiti,
otu na okusa.

90:
Oomvula eyuvi limwe koshipala shoye odha fa owala esiku limwe;
ongesiku lyohela lya pita,
nenge otundi yimwe muusiku.

Aantu oto ya kombo po thilu;
otaa piti po mbala ya fa ondjodhi.
Omuntu okwa fa omwiidhi tagu tsapuka pepito lyetango.

Omayono getu owe ga kaleke koshipala shoye;
oondjo dhetu dhomeholamo
owe dhi holola puuyelele.

91:
Ote ku siikile nomawawa ge;
megameno lye kamu na iiponga;
oku shi kwiinekelwa,
oye eshigo nepopilo lyoye.

Kalunga ote ku tumine aayengeli ye,
ye ku gamene;
otaye ku shigi shaa mpoka to yi.

92:
Omuwa, iilongankondo yoye otayi nyanyudha ndje;
otandi imbi nda nyanyukwa
molwaashoka we shi longo.

Aatondi yoye, Omuwa,
otaa ka hula po;
aakolokoshi ayehe otaa ka kana po.

94:
Ote ya geelele uukolokoshi wawo
note ya yono po molwomayono gawo;
Omuwa Kalunga ketu ote ke ya hulitha po.

95:
Efuta oli li miikaha ye,
oshoka oye e li shiti;
oye e eta po evi ekukutu.

Ileni, tu isizimikeni kuye,
tu mu simanekeni;
tu tseni oongolo koshipala shOmuwa, Omushiti gwetu!

97:
Kehe ngoka ha simaneke iimenka,
ota sithwa ohoni;
iikalunga ayihe oyi na okutsila Omuwa oongolo.

Omuwa Omunankondoawike,
ongoye omupangeli kombanda yevi alihe;
ngoye omunene u vule iikalunga.

Aayuuki otaa ende muuyelele;
mboka ye na oomwenyo dha yela,
otaa nyanyukwa.

98:
Imbileni Omuwa ondjimbo ompe;
okwa longo iilonga iikumithi!
Okoonkondo dhe oonene a sindana.

99:
Simanekeni Omuwa Kalunga ketu;
isizimikeni koompadhi dhe!
Oye omuyapuki!

Okwe ya popitha e li moshikogo;
oyo noya vulika komalombwelo
nokiipango ye.

100:
Tseyeni Omuwa oye Kalunga.
Oye okwe tu shiti, otse oye;
otse aantu ye noonzi dhuusita we.

Piteni miiyelo yotempeli ye nomapandulo;
ileni melongelokalunga nomahambelelo.
Mu panduleni ne mu simaneke edhina lye.

Oshoka Omuwa oye omwaanawa;
esilohenda lye otali kala aluhe,
nuudhiginini we komaluvalo nomaluvalo.

101:
noitandi popile nando uukolokoshi.
lilonga yaashunimonima otandi yi tondo;
noitandi kwatathana nayo

Omufundja ita pitikwa,
a kale megumbo lyandje;
omufudhime ita kala koshipala shandje.

102:
Esiku kehe aatondi yandje otaa sheke ndje;
otaa yolo ndje notaa tumbula
edhina lyandje nomusheko.

Oto yeluka, u sile Sion ohenda;
ethimbo olya thiki oku shi etela olukeno.
Ndika olyo ethimbo lyo opala.

Hambeleleni Omuwa,
ne oonakukala megulu;
nota ka simanekwa muJerusalem,

Kalunga, ino kutha ndje po,
manga inaandi kulupa.
Omuwa, ou na omwenyo aluhe sigo aluhe;

103:
Hambeleleni Omuwa,
ne oonakukala megulu;
aapiya ye amuhe mbo hamu gwanitha ehalo lye.

104:
Mwenyo gwandje, hambelela Omuwa.
Omuwa Kalunga kandje, ongoye omunene ngiini!
Owa zala esimano neadhimo;

Sho wi iganda, omeya oga yi ontuku;
oga fadhuka po,
sho gu uvu endundumo lyelombwelo lyoye.

Oonimegona ohadhi pumbu,
sho tadhi kongo iikulya;
Kalunga ote dhi pe iipalutha yadho.

Uuna to yi etha, otayi haluka;
ngele to kutha po omufudho gwayo, otayi si
notayi shuna montsi yevi.

Ihe ngele to yi pe omufudho,
nena otayi shitwa;
oto pepaleke olupe lwevi.

Onda hala okwiimbila Omuwa omasiku gandje agehe;
onda hala okuhambelela Kalunga kandje,
manga ndi na omwenyo.

105:
Hambeleleni Omuwa,
uvitheni uunene we;
lombweleni iigwana shoka a longo.

Omuwa okwa pe aantu ye oluvalo olwindji;
okwe ya ningi aanankondo
ye vule aatondi yawo.

Nena okwa piitha mo Aaisraeli;
oya zi mo noshisiliveli noshingoli,
naayehe oya li aayamba naanankondo.

Oye mu pula nokwe ya tumine iimote;
okwe ya pe iikulya yomegulu,
e ya paluthe.

106:
Hambeleleni Omuwa!
Gandjeni omapandulo kOmuwa, oshoka ye omwaanawa;
ohole ye oyaaluhe.

Omuwa, dhimbulukwa ndje,
uuna to sile aantu yoye ohenda;
hupitha ndje wo, uuna to ya hupitha.

108:
Ohole yoye yaa na ndjele,
oya tsa kegulu;
uudhiginini woye otau thiki keyalelo.

Tu hupitha noonkondo dhoye;
zimina eindilo lyandje,
aaholike yoye opo ya hupithwe.

Gilead oshandje, naManasse osho tuu;
Efraim oye egala lyandje lyosheela,
naJuda oye ondhimbo yandje yuukwaniilwa.

109:
Oongolo dhandje odha nongwa,
sho ndaa na iikulya;
onda nanga omasipa gowala.

110:
Omuwa oku li kolulyo lwoye;
uuna ta ka geya,
ota ka sinda aakwaniilwa.

Ota ka geela iigwana,
nomidhimba otadhi ka lala apehe;
ota ka sinda aakwaniilwa kombanda yevi alihe.

111:
Ashihe shoka te shi longo,
oshi na esimano nomutumbo;
uuyuuki we otau kala aluhe.

Iilongankondo yOmuwa itayi dhimbiwa;
oye omunamutimahenda
nomunalukeno.

Mboka haye mu simaneke,
ote ya pe iipalutha;
ita dhimbwa ehangano lye sigo aluhe.

Okutila Omuwa okwo ekota lyuunongo;
Omuwa ota nongeke ayehe mboka haa vulika kuye.
Na simanekwe aluhe sigo aluhe!

112:
Oha kwatha oohepele,
nakehe shoka te shi longo, oshu uka notashi kalelele;
esimano lye otali indjipala.

113:
Omukiintu ihaa vala ote mu simanekele megumbo lye;
ote mu nyanyudha noku mu pa oluvalo.
Halleluja!

115:
Oyi na iikaha, ihe itayi vulu okukwata sha;
oyi na oompadhi, ihe itayi vulu okweenda;
momakana gayo ihamu zi ewi lyasha.

116:
Eeno, Omuwa, ngame omuntu gwoye;
ohandi ku longele, ngaashi meme a li.
Ongoye wa hupitha ndje meso.

118:
Omuwa oku li pamwe nangame,
onkee itandi tila sha;
aantu otaa ningi ndje shike?

Omuwa oku li pamwe nangame,
oye omukwathi gwandje;
ota ka sindila ndje aatondi yandje.

Omuwa okwa ningi ndje omunankondo,
notandi mu hambelele;
oye omuhupithi gwandje.

119:
Onda hempulula iilonga yandje,
ongoye nowa yamukula ndje;
longa ndje omautho goye.

Onda hala okuvulika kiipango yoye;
pe ndje omwenyo,
oshoka ongoye omuyuuki.

Onda puka nda fa onzi ya kana;
konga omupiya gwoye,
oshoka iipango yoye inandi yi dhimbwa.

130:
Israel, inekela Omuwa,
oshoka ohole ye ihayi lunduluka;
okwi ilongekidha aluhe okuhupitha.

132:
Oshikethahangano otwe shi kundana,
manga shi li muEfrata;
otwe shi mono momalundu gaJaar.

Omuwa okwa hogolola Sion;
okwa hala shi kale omutumba gwe
ta ti:

136:
etango lyokupangela omutenya,
oshoka esilohenda lye
otali kala aluhe;

Oye ngoka a dhipaga po iisheelimati yAayegipiti;
oshoka esilohenda lye
otali kala aluhe.

138:
Sho nde ku ithana,
owu uvu omagalikano gandje;
owa nyatipaleke ndje nowa koleke ndje.

Omuwa, oto shi ningile ndje.
Omuwa, esilohenda lyoye otali kala aluhe;
ino etha iilonga yiikaha yoye.

139:
Ou wete ndje, ngele tandi yi kiilonga
nenge te vululukwa;
ashihe shoka te ningi, ou shi wete.

Ngele tandi londo kegulu, oko u li;
ngele tandi ka lala muuyuni wokuusi,
naamoka omo u li.

Konakona ndje, Kalunga,
ngoye u tseye omutima gwandje;
tala ndje, u dhimbulule omadhiladhilo gandje.

140:
Oonakuholuuntsa, otaa tegele ndje oomwigo meholamo;
otaa tegele ndje oshiliya
notaa fulile ndje ekelo mondjila.

Omuwa, aakaanakalunga ino ya pitikila omakamba gawo;
ino etha oompangela dhawo dhi tompole sha,
opo yaa inenepeke.

Ya tilahila omakala gomulilo;
naa umbilwe meziko lyomulilo
nomolumbogo moka itaa ka za mo.

141:
Omuwa, otandi ku ithana;
endelela, u ye kungame!
Uva eigidho lyegalikano lyandje!

Taamba omagalikano gandje ngaashi omatsinino;
okuyelutha iikaha yandje
naku ninge eyambo lyongulohi

Gamena ndje, ndaa hongololwe,
ndaa longe uulunde pamwe naakolokoshi;
ino etha, ndi ye kiituthi yawo.

Onde ku inekela, Omuwa Omupangeliawike;
omungoye tandi kongo egameno;
ino ethela ndje meso.

142:
Otandi ithana Omuwa, a kwathe ndje;
otandi yeluthile ewi lyandje kOmuwa,
a sile ndje ohenda.

Omuwa, otandi ku kugile ekwatho;
ongoye omugameni gwandje;
ongoye awike nda pumbwa mokukalamwenyo kwandje.

143:
Omutondi ota tidhagana ndje
e ta hata ndje pevi;
otu undulile ndje momilema, ongaamboka ya sa nale.

Otandi dhimbulukwa omasiku gonale;
otandi tedhatedha ayihe mbyoka we yi ninga,
notandi dhiladhila iilonga yoye ayihe.

Otandi yelutha omaako gandje kungoye;
onde ku yuulukwa nda fa evi lya kukuta
evi lya pumbwa omvula.

144:
Omuwa na hambelelwe,
oye omugameni gwandje;
ota longekidhile ndje olugodhi.

Adhimitha olwaadhi,
u halakanithe aatondi yoye;
umba iikuti e to ya piyaganeke.

145:
Otandi ku simaneke Kalunga,
omukwaniilwa gwandje;
otandi tanga edhina lyoye aluhe sigo aluhe.

Nandi hambelele aluhe Omuwa;
iishitwa ayihe nayi simaneke edhina lye eyapuki
aluhe sigo aluhe.

147:
Halleluja! Hambeleleni Omuwa!
Osho opala okuhambelela Kalunga ketu;
oshu uka oku mu imbila omahambelelo.

Eyalelo ote li siikile niikogo;
evi ote li lokithile omvula
nota kokitha omwiidhi komalundu.

Ihe kelombwelo lye olumi otalu hemuka;
ngele ta pepitha ombepo ompyu,
omeya otaga tameke oku kunguluka.

148:
Hambeleleni Omuwa,
ne oondundu niikulundundu,
omiti dhiiyimati naandhoka dhomokuti;

Mu hambeleleni,
ne aakwaniilwa naantu ayehe,
aana yokombanda naapangeli ayehe;

Ayihe nayi hambelele edhina lyOmuwa;
edhina lye olyo alike li na okusimanekwa;
esimano lye oli li kombanda yevi nomegulu.

149:
Halleluja! Hambeleleni Omuwa!
Imbileni Omuwa eimbilo epe;
imbeni ehambelelo megongalo lyaantu ye.

1:
Ezimba lyomugwayo gwoye olya nika nawa;
ezimba lyoye olya fa omugwayo gwa pimpwa mo.
Omolwashoka aafuko ye ku hole.

2:
Omuholike gwandje okwa lombwele ndje a ti:
“Kanuunyalona kandje, yambuka;
nandjelo gwandje, ila!

8:
Salomo okwa li e na oshitsambe shomiviinu kuBaal Hamon;
okwe shi thitha kaanashitsambe.
Kehe ngoka oku na okufuta iimaliwa yoshisiliveli eyuvi omolwiiyimati yasho.

25:
Omuwa, ongoye Kalunga kandje;
otandi ku simaneke nokuhambelela edhina lyoye.
Owa longo iikumithalonga;
muudhiginini woye owa gwanitha oompangela ndhoka wa pangele nalenale.

26:
Okwa fupipike mboka ya li tayi inomo;
okwa kumuna po oshilando shawo sha kola,
nomakuma gasho okwe ga nyanyulile montsi.

Omuwa, ongoye to tu pe elago;
ashihe shoka tatu tompola,
ongoye we shi tu ningile.

40:
ongomusita ta litha oshigunda she;
oonzigona ote dhi gongele pamwe
noku dhi humbata momaako ge;
oonyali ote dhi sisidha nawa.

ihe mboka taa inekele Omuwa,
ohaa mono oonkondo oompe.
Oya fa oontsa tadhi yelutha omawawa pombanda;
ohaa matuka yo itaa vulwa;
otaye ende noitaa loloka.

41:
“Aantu yokokule oya mono shoka nda longo;
oya haluka nokukakama kuumbanda.
Omolwashoka ya gongala e taye ya.

Oshoka ongame Omuwa Kalunga koye;
otandi ku tsu omukumo te ti:
‘Ino tila; otandi ku kwatha.’ ”

Oto ke dhi gunda mombanda;
ombepo otayi dhi pepe po,
notadhi ka halakanithwa koshikungulu.
Nena ngoye oto ka kala u na enyanyu, oshoka ongame Kalunga koye;
oto ka hambelela ndje, ngame Kalunga kaIsrael omuyapuki.”

Sho nda tala mokati kookalunga,
kamu na nando ogumwe gwomuyo ta vulu okutya sha;
kamu na nando ogumwe ta vulu okuyamukula omapulo gandje.

42:
Ita ka tenguka nenge a tyololoke;
ota taandelitha uuyuuki kombanda yevi.
Oontuntu dhomefuta otadhi tegelele elongo lye.”

Kalunga okwa shiti egulu nokwe li alele;
oye a yala nokwaaneka evi naayihe mbyoka yi li mo;
aantu ayehe okwe ya pe omwenyo nomufudho.
Ngashingeyi Omuwa Kalunga ota lombwele omupiya gwe ta ti:

“Ongame awike Omuwa, Kalunga koye.
Itandi gandja esimano lyandje kugulwe;
itandi etha okusimanekwa kwandje ku ye kiimenka.

Imbileni Omuwa eimbilo epe;
mu imbileni ondjimbohambelelo, ooha ne dhuuyuni!
Mu hambeleleni, one mboka hamu thayile kefuta;
mu hambeleleni, iishitwa ayihe yomefuta!
Imbeni oondjimbohambelelo, oontuntu ne dhomefuta
none oonakukala mudho!

Omuwa ota piti mo a ka kondje ngashika omukwiita ofule;
okwi ilongekidha nokwa pupyalela olugodhi.
Ota tsu onkalu, ta hiki ohiya yolugodhi;
aatondi ye ote ya hololele oonkondo dhe.

Okwe tu tilile ondjahi ye ya hwama niita iilulululu.
Ondjahi ye oya tukulukile Israel ya fa omulilo;
ihe ina ndhindhilika ye ina tseya sha.

43:
Ongame Kalunga nosho te kala aluheluhe.
Kaku na ngoka ta hunuka miikaha yandje;
kaku na ngoka ta lundulula shoka tandi ningi.”

Omuwa ota ti:
“Israel, wa kunyukwa ndje nduno;
ku na we nangame, Jakob.

naaleli yeni ya shekitha uuyapuki wandje.
Onkee onda hanagula po Israel;
onde etha aantu yandje mwene ya shekwe.”

45:
Otandi shiti uuyelele nomilema;
ohandi eta eyambeko nethingano.
Ongame, Omuwa, tandi ningi ayihe mbika.

Ihe Israel ota hupithwa kOmuwa,
nesimano lye otali ka kala sigo aluhe;
aantu ye itaa ka sithwa ohoni nando.”

46:
Iimenka itayi vulu okwiihupitha yo yene;
otayi kwatwa po notayi yiwa nayo.
Ndika olyo ehulilo lyiimenka yaBabilon.

Aantu taa dhitula oompunda dhawo e taa pimpi mo oshingoli;
otaa vihi oshisiliveli moshiviha.
Otaa futu omuhambuli gwoshingoli, a hambule oshimenka;
otaye shi inyongamene e taye shi simaneke!

Dhimbulukweni shoka sha ningilwe konale ndjo;
shi konakoneni kutya ongame awike Kalunga,
nokaku na we gulwe e thike pungame.

47:
Aantu otaa tala epenge lyoye;
otaa ka tala okufupipikwa kwoye nohoni yoye.
Ondi na onkone, nokape na ngoka ta politha ndje.”

“Shilando ngoye, omufuko gwAababilon,
kuutumba wa tya thilu, inda momilema;
ito ithanwa we omunyekadhi gwiigwana.

Onda geele aantu yandje;
onda kala nayo ya fa yaa shi yandje.
Onde ya gandja miikaha yoye,
ongoye noino ya sila nando ohenda;
naakulupe owe ya ningi onyanya.

48:
Omuwa ota lombwele Israel ta ti:
“Onda hunganeke nale mbyoka tayi ka ningwa;
ohaluka onde yi gwanitha.

Ando to pulakene shili iipango yandje,
andola omayambeko otage ku kungulukile ga fa omulonga tagu tondoka omeya,
nuuyuuki otau tondokele kungoye wa fa omakuthikuthi gomefuta;

49:
Okwa lombwele ndje a ti:
“Israel, ngoye omupiya gwandje;
omolwoye iigwana tayi ka hambelela ndje.”

Manga inaandi valwa, okwa utha ndje;
okwa lenge ndje, ndi ninge omupiya gwe,
ndi galule aantu ye,
ndi galule Aaisraeli mboka ya halakana.
Omuwa ta simaneke ndje;
oye othithiya yoonkondo dhandje.

51:
Otandi ya mbala ndi yi hupithe;
ethimbo lyesindano lyandje olya thikana.
Ongame mwene tii ka lela iigwana.
Iilongo yokokule tayi tegelele ndje ndi ye kuyo;
etegameno lyayo oli li mungame, ndi yi hupithe.

Ligameneni kegulu, ne mu tale kombanda yevi!
Egulu otali ka kagunyuka po lya fa olwithi;
nevi tali ka kulupa lya fa onguwo onkulu,
naantu yalyo otaa ka sa po ya fa oondhi.
Ihe ekulilo tandi li eta, otali ka kala aluheluhe;
nesindano lyandje olyo lyahugunina.

Oonkwatwa otadhi ka mangululwa mbala;
otadhi ka kala kombanda yevi omimvo odhindji,
otadhi ka kala niikulya dhe yi pumbwa.

52:
Tala, omupiya gwandje ota ka hepuluka;
ota ka yelwa pombanda,
ta simanekwa nokutumbalekwa unene.

54:
Tamununa etsali lyoye li ninge enene;
oongodhi dhalyo dhi hilila kokule
noomboha dhadho dhi dhengela muule.

Ngele oku na ngoka te ku matukile,
kashi shi pazimino lyandje;
ngoka te ku kondjitha, ota ka teka po.

60:
Ligamena koombinga noombinga.
Ayehe oya gongala notaa ya kungoye;
aamwoye aamati otaa ya taa zi kokule,
naamwoye aakadhona taa kwiininwa.
Oto ke shi mona e to adhima;

2:
“Israel ke shi omupika;
ina valelwa nando omuupika.
Omolwashike ano a ningi oshihakanwa shaatondi?

3:
Galukeni, one amuhe mboka mwi iteka Omuwa;
ote ke mu aludha e te mu ningi aainekelwa.
Otamu ti: “Eeno, otatu ya kOmuwa, oshoka oye Kalunga ketu.

4:
Evi lyo ondoka olya mbugala;
iilando yalyo oya ningi omakulukuma
molwoohandje dhondjahi yOmuwa.

8:
Omwenyo gwandje ogwa nyanyagulwa,
oshoka aantu yandje oya nyanyagulwa;
otandi lili; onda haluka nayi.

10:
Omuwa, kaku na ngoka e ku fa;
ongoye omunankondo,
nedhina lyoye enene noli na oonkondo.

Omuwa okwa shiti evi koonkondo dhe;
nokuunongo we okwa umbu uuyuni
nokwa alele omagulu.

Oyo iinima yowala noyi na okudhinika;
otayi ka hanagulwa po kOmuwa,
ngele te ya e yi pangule.

Omatsali getu oga finyunwa po;
oongodhi dhago odha tokolwa.
Aanona yetu oya yiwa nayo;
inapa kala nando ogumwe, a dhike po ishewe omatsali getu;
kaku na ngoka ta yelutha omalapi gago.”

Omuwa,
ondi shi shi kutya omuntu iha vulu okupangela shoka u uthilwa;
kaku na omuntu hu utha okukalamwenyo kwe.

12:
Nokuli aamwanyoko, yomaandjeni, oye ku gwaaleke;
oya pangele ye ku ponokele.
Ino ya inekela, nando taa popi oohapu oontalala.”

Aaleli oyendji aakwiilongo
oya hanagula po oshitsambe shandje shomiviinu;
oya lyatagula po epya lyandje;
evi lyandje eholike ye li mbugaleke.

Aahanaguli oye ya ya taakana omalondo gomombuga.
Onda tumu egongamwele okudhipaga oshilongo ashihe;
kape na ngoka ta kala e na ombili.

18:
Ihe aantu yandje oya dhimbwa ndje;
otaa fikile iimenka iitsinino.
Oya puka mo mondjila ndjoka ya li ye na okweenda nayo,
itaa landula we ondjila yandje;
otaa ende nomapola inaaga palwa.

Oya ningi evi lyawo eha lyehalutho, li dhinike sigo aluhe.
Ayehe mboka taa piti po, otaa pukapuka komitse;
otaa haluka ya kumwa.

22:
Okwa popile oohepele naakweyi moontamanana;
naayihe oye ende nawa.
Shika otashi ti okutseya Omuwa.

23:
Omuwa ota ti:
“Aahunganeki naayambi oyo aakaanakalunga;
onde ya adhelele taa yonene motempeli yandje.

25:
Yalwe mboka ya nu moshitenga, oyo mbaka: Omukwaniilwa gwaEgipiti, omalenga naawiliki ye;
Aayegipiti ayehe naakwiilongo ayehe muEgipiti;
Aakwaniilwa ayehe yoshilongo Uz;
Aakwaniilwa ayehe yiilando yAafilisti Ashkelon, Gaza, Ekron noshihupe shaAshdod;
Aaedom, Aamoabi nAayammoni;
aakwaniilwa ayehe yaTiro naSidon;
aakwaniilwa ayehe yomiilongo yopEfuta lyopokati;
iilando Dedan, Tema naBus;
aantu ayehe mboka yi ikulula omapalu;
aakwaniilwa yaArabia ayehe;
aakwaniilwa ayehe yomazimo gokombuga;
aakwaniilwa ayehe yaSimri noyaElam naMedia;
aakwaniilwa ayehe yokuumbangalantu, popepi nokokule, nguka naangwiyaka.
Oshigwana kehe kombanda yevi osha li shi na okunwa mo. Hugunina omukwaniilwa gwaBabilonia ta ka nwa mo.

30:
“Omupiya gwandje Jakob, ino tila;
oshigwana shaIsrael, ino haluka.
Otandi ke mu hupitha moshilongo shokokule,
moshilongo moka mwa pongekelwa mo.
Otamu ka galukila kegumbo notamu kala nombili;
otamu ka gamenwa, nokape na ngoka te mu tilitha.

Aaholi yoye ayehe oye ku dhimbwa;
kaye na ko nasha nangoye.
Onde ku ponokele nda fa omutondi;
egeelo lyoye olya ningi enene,
oshoka omayono goye ogendji,
nuukolokoshi woye uunene.

Aantu yamo otaa ka imba ekandanga;
otaa ka ligola kenyanyu.
Okeyambeko lyandje taa ka indjipala;
eyambeko lyandje otali ya simanekitha.

Aana yawo otaa ka kala ngaashi muuyuni wonale,
egongalo lyawo otali ka kala lya kola koshipala shandje;
otandi ka geela mboka taye ya hepeke.

31:
Oluvalo lwoye olu na etegameno komeho;
aamwoye otaa ka galukila kegumbo.
Ongame, Omuwa, nda popi.

46:
Aanandapolela itaa hunuka mo;
aakwiita itaa vulu okufadhuka po.
Muumbangalantu waEufrat otaa tantala e taa punduka.

e taa mbugaleke omugulu omunene.
Aantu yawo ya nyengana okuyalulwa;
aakwiita yawo oyendji ye vule oombahu.

Aayegipiti otaa sithwa ohoni;
otaa sindika kaaumbangalantu.
Ongame, Omuwa, nda popi.”

48:
Kape na oshilando tashi yanda ehanagulo;
esilu nolushandja otalu ka hanagulwa po.
Ongame, Omuwa, nda popi.

50:
“Oku na aantu taa ziilile koshilongo shokuumbangalantu,
oshigwana oshinankondo otashi zi kokule;
aakwaniilwa oyendji otaa ilongekidhile iita.

51:
Oyo iinima yowala noyi na okudhinika;
otayi ka hanagulwa po,
Omuwa ngele te ya e yi pangule.

1:
Omapola gu uka kuSion, otaga lili oosa;
kaku na we ngoka te ya kiituthi ye.
Omiyelo dhoshilando odha teywa po,
naayambi otaa tsu omazima.
Aakadhona ye oya yemata;
Sion mwene okwa lulilwa.

Onyata ye oya kakatela koohulukweya dhe.
Ina yaguma nando ehulilo lya fa ndika.
Okutekapo kwe okwa li okukumithi;
ke na ngoka te mu talaleke.
“Omuwa, tala efupipiko lyandje;
aatondi yandje otaa imbi ekandanga.”

2:
Omuwa okwa fa omutondi;
okwa hanagula po Israel.
Okwa kombo po oombala dhe adhihe;
a silukitha omapopilongulu ge.
Okwi indjipalitha oluhodhi
nelilagano lyomukadhona

4:
Omukadhona Sion, ongunga yuulunde woye ya futwa;
Omuwa ite ke ku konda mo we.
Omukadhona Edom, uulunde woye otau ka geelwa;
Omuwa ota ka holola oondjo dhoye puuyelele.

2:
Omathimbo nomimvo ote dhi lundulula;
ota kwaniileke aakwaniilwa noku ya shundula;
aanongo ote ya pe uunongo naanandunge omayele.

Ota holola iinima yomuule noya holekwa;
ota tseya mbyoka ya holekwa momilema
noye mwene okwa kundukidhwa kuuyelele.

Israel, otandi ke ku hokana;
ote kala omunashili nomwiinekelwa;
otandi ke ku hololela ohole yokolela nesilohenda;
oto ka hokanekeka ndongo aluhe.

11:
Ihe mpoka pa thika nde mu ithana, opo pe thika a pilamene ndje.
Aantu yandje oya yambele Baal;
oya lungunithile iimenka omidhidhindjambo

Onde ya hilile kungame nolukeno nohole.
Onde ya yambulile komapepe gandje;
onda kuutumba e tandi ya palutha niikulya.

14:
Oshigwana shaIsrael
itashi kala we shi na sha niimenka;
otandi yamukula omagalikano gawo
e tandi ya sile oshimpwiyu.
Ongomuti gwokwaziza tandi ke ya shiga;
ongame othithiya yomayambeko agehe.”

1:
Shi hokololeleni aana yeni;
oyo naye shi hokololele oyana,
noyana naye ke shi hokololele oluvalo talu ya.

Ne oonkolwi, tonateni ne mu lile;
takumeni, ne aanwi yomaviinu;
omandjembele gokukolwa omaviinu omape oga yonwa po.

Oshipupu shoombahu osha ponokele evi lyetu;
odhi na oonkondo nodhindji tadhi nyengana okuyalulwa;
omayego gadho oga tsa ga fa gonime.

Omapya oge li owala;
evi otali lili, oshoka iilya oya yonagulwa po,
omahila goomviinu oga kukuta, nomiolivi odha ganya.

Aanamapya, seni oluhodhi;
lileni ne mboka hamu dhiginine iitsambe yomiviinu,
oshoka osiima niishokelya, eeno, iimeno ayihe oya yonagulwa po.

Omiviinu nomikwiyu odha ganya;
omiti adhihe dhiiyimati odha kukuta.
Enyanyu lyoshigwana olya kana.

Esiku lyOmuwa oli li popepi;
esiku uuna Omunankondoawike te eta ehanagulo.
Esiku ndyoka otali eta uumbanda u thike peni!

Iimuna otayi lilagana kuulumbu,
oshoka kayi na oshinapelo;
iigunda yoonzi otayi tala omalwa.

2:
Ngele tadhi hedha ko,
shaa ngoka ota haluka;
oshipala kehe otashi pembe.

Otadhi matukile oshilando;
otadhi kondo omakuma;
otadhi londo omagumbo
notadhi yi mo tadhi pitile momakende ngaafuthi.

Tuuleni omitima dheni, mu holole oluhodhi;
okutuula oonguwo dheni inaku gwana.”
Galukileni kOmuwa Kalunga keni.
Oye omunambili nomunesilohenda;
oye omunalukeno nota dhiginine omauvaneko ge.

Hikeni ombenda kondundu Sion;
gandjeni elombwelo lyeidhiliko,
hiyeni oshigongi!

Gongeleni aantu ayehe;
ya longekidhileni oshigongi oshiyapuki;
eteni aantu aakuluntu;
gongeleni aanona nuuhanona wo.
Nokuli ombushiki na ze mondunda ye nomufuko mondjugo ye,
opo ye ye koshigongi.

3:
“Tseyithileni shika mokati kiigwana:
‘Ilongekidhileni iita;
hiyeni omatanga geni;
gongeleni aakwiita ayehe, mu katuke!

Omuwa ota pumbu kondundu Sion;
ewi lye otali ndunduma muJerusalem;
evi newangandjo otayi kakama.
Ihe ota ka popila aantu ye.

1:
Einomo lyoye otali ku ningilile mo.
Ngoye owa kala mohote yokondundu;
egumbo lyoye oli li kokule mokati koondundu;
onkee oto ilombwele e to ti:
‘Olye ando ta vulu okuhata ndje pevi?’

“Aantu taa zi kuumbugantu waJuda,
otaa ka kwata po Edom;
mboka taa zi kiikulundundu yokuuninginino,
otaa ka kwata po evi lyAafilisti;
Aaisraeli otaa ka lala oshitopolwa shaEfraim naSamaria;
Aabenjamin otaa ka kutha po Gilead.

Omuwa Kalunga iti idhidhimikile mboka taa iyeleke naye;
ota geele mboka taye mu kondjitha.
Mondjahi ote shi ya galulile.

Oondundu otadhi tengatenga montaneho yOmuwa;
iikulundundu otayi hemuka koshipala she.
Uuna Omuwa ta holoka, evi otali telagana;
uuyuni naantu ayehe otaa kakama.

Omuwa oye omwaanawa;
ota gamene aantu ye methimbo lyuudhigu;
ota sile oshimpwiyu ayehe mboka ye mu inekela.

Aatondi ye ote ya hanagula po thiluthilu
ngefundja tali tondoka;
mboka taye mu kondjitha, ote ya unzile meso.

2:
Omunyekadhi ota kwatwa omupika;
aadhike ye taa lili ya fa oonguti
notayi ikwata pontulo koluhodhi.

Ninive otashi hanagulwa po,
tashi thigwa po, tashi mbugalekwa!
Omitima otadhi kukuta kuumbanda;
oongolo otadhi tifauka,
oonkondo dha kana;
iipala otayi pembe.

3:
Ote ya mokushela kwolwaadhi;
uuyelele tau gena tau zi miikaha ye,
omo oonkondo dhe dha holekwa.

Omuwa a hulitha po oku ku geela;
okwa kutha po aatondi yoye ayehe.
Omuwa, omukwaniilwa gwaIsrael,
oku li pungoye;
onkee ito pumbwa we okutila.

10:
Otii ka nkondopaleka aantu yandje;
otaa ka simaneka ndje nokuvulika kungame.”
Omuwa oye a popi adhihe ndhika.

3:
Omasilu agehe naga filwe po;
oondundu niikulundundu ayihe nayi kumunwe po;
oondjila dha goyoka nadhi ukililithwe;
iisilukutumba nayi yelekanithwe.

4:
Ngashika enyolo tali ti:
“Sho a londo a yi kombandambanda, okwa faalele oonkwatwa odhindji;
oye okwa pe aantu omagano.”

1:
Ongoye ou hole shoka shu uka nou tonde shoka sha puka;
onkee Omuwa Kalunga koye okwe ku lenge
nokwe ku pe esimano e te ku nyanyudha nenyanyu enene li vule lyayalwe.”

2:
Ngaashi ta ti:
“Kalunga, otii ku hokolola paamwameme;
Otii ku imbile omaimbilo montaneho yegongalo alihe.”

3:
Oshoka omeho gOmuwa oge wete aayuuki,
naaluhe ota pulakene omaindilo gawo;
ihe ota thigi po mboka haa longo uuwinayi.”
